WEBVTT

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.334
Good news, everyone.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:45.462
Several years ago,
I tried to log on to AOL,

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.006
and it just went through. Whee!

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:49.758
We're online.

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:52.177
Go ahead, get into these net suits.

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:54.847
I designed and tested them myself.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:57.766
They smell like
burning rhesus monkey.

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:00.143
Really? I guess
when you're around it all day

00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:01.603
you stop noticing.

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:03.564
Off you go.

00:01:08.527 --> 00:01:09.528
Hey.

00:01:09.862 --> 00:01:10.863
Ha!

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:14.575
Behold!

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:16.451
The Internet!

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:22.875
My god.

00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:25.002
It's full of ads.

00:01:43.812 --> 00:01:44.938
Follow me.

00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:52.779
It's immense.

00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:56.158
It's got every piece of information
anyone could ever want.

00:01:56.992 --> 00:01:58.452
So I see.

00:01:58.535 --> 00:02:00.579
- Woo-hoo!
- Oh, yeah!

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:02.456
What? What's going on here?

00:02:13.091 --> 00:02:14.593
Hey, that's me.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:15.761
No, it isn't.

00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:20.432
I just took some pictures of your face
and stuck them on someone else's body.

00:02:20.516 --> 00:02:21.600
Hey.

00:02:25.062 --> 00:02:26.730
Are you over 18?

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.524
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:02:29.274 --> 00:02:30.734
Hi.

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:32.110
I'm telling you, Fry,

00:02:32.194 --> 00:02:34.780
they've got a chat room for everybody.

00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:35.948
And here it is.

00:02:36.532 --> 00:02:39.284
- Ew. That is so gross.
- Yeah.

00:02:39.368 --> 00:02:41.912
- I'll stick with this one, thank you.
- Yeah.

00:02:54.883 --> 00:02:55.884
Hi.

00:02:55.968 --> 00:03:00.013
I'm a naughty nurse
and I really need someone to talk to.

00:03:00.097 --> 00:03:01.682
$9.95 a minute.

00:03:01.807 --> 00:03:04.268
Oh! You're a dollar naughtier than most.

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:07.813
So, how about them knicks?

00:03:11.713 --> 00:03:14.591
Hello? Are there any girls
in this room at all?

00:03:14.695 --> 00:03:17.990
Yeah. Bring on the hot chicks
'cause I'm a hot stud.

00:03:18.073 --> 00:03:19.533
- Yeah.
- So are we.

00:03:19.658 --> 00:03:21.493
I'm a woman
if that's what you mean.

00:03:21.577 --> 00:03:23.036
It's a girl.

00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:27.207
I don't like to play games,
so I'll just say I'm a cyclops.

00:03:27.291 --> 00:03:30.669
I'm a spaceship captain.
I'm the only one of my species.

00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:32.504
And I'm interested in meeting a man.

00:03:32.588 --> 00:03:33.630
A woman?

00:03:33.755 --> 00:03:35.007
I'm scared.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.344
Well, thanks to the Internet,
I'm now bored with sex.

00:03:39.428 --> 00:03:42.556
Is there a place on the web that
panders to my lust for violence?

00:03:42.639 --> 00:03:44.850
Is the space pope reptilian?

00:03:45.767 --> 00:03:47.186
Get ready for fun, Fry.

00:03:47.269 --> 00:03:50.939
Nowadays we have a type of game
played entirely on video.

00:03:51.023 --> 00:03:53.066
We call it a video game.

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:55.235
Uh, a video game, you say?

00:03:55.319 --> 00:03:56.862
Well, golly gee.

00:03:56.945 --> 00:04:00.574
You mighty spacemen of the future
will have to show me how it works.

00:04:21.428 --> 00:04:22.429
Hmm.

00:04:33.857 --> 00:04:35.692
The doctor is in.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:39.780
The doctor is out.

00:04:40.364 --> 00:04:43.283
Everyone, please sign off.
We have a delivery.

00:04:43.408 --> 00:04:45.494
Plus I have to use the phone to...

00:04:56.797 --> 00:04:59.132
Leela, please tell the others that...

00:05:34.626 --> 00:05:35.627
Who are you?

00:05:35.711 --> 00:05:37.004
I saw you in the chat room

00:05:37.129 --> 00:05:39.381
But you left before I had
a chance to talk to you.

00:05:39.506 --> 00:05:43.385
After all these years of
searching for another cyclops.

00:05:43.468 --> 00:05:44.761
I can't believe it.

00:05:44.887 --> 00:05:47.097
I've dreamed of this moment all my life.

00:05:47.181 --> 00:05:50.100
Do you think perhaps, you and I...

00:05:52.561 --> 00:05:53.604
Ha-ha!

00:05:55.147 --> 00:05:56.523
Fry, you idiot.

00:05:56.607 --> 00:05:58.275
Ever since I was abandoned on Earth

00:05:58.358 --> 00:06:00.652
I've been searching for who my people are

00:06:00.736 --> 00:06:02.196
and where they come from.

00:06:02.279 --> 00:06:04.823
Then I finally meet another cyclops
and you blast him.

00:06:04.907 --> 00:06:07.743
You wrecked my one chance
to learn who I am.

00:06:07.826 --> 00:06:10.412
Oh, Leela, I feel terrible.

00:06:10.495 --> 00:06:12.122
If there's anything I can ever do...

00:06:12.206 --> 00:06:13.207
Gotcha.

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:16.376
I won!

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:17.794
I'm the greatest!

00:06:22.257 --> 00:06:23.926
Come on. We have work to do.

00:06:32.476 --> 00:06:36.021
Are you still mad at me for wrecking
your once-in-a-lifetime chance

00:06:36.146 --> 00:06:37.814
to learn the meaning of your existence?

00:06:37.898 --> 00:06:40.901
No. I'm just happy you were able
to win a video game.

00:06:40.984 --> 00:06:43.904
Now let's concentrate on getting
this desperately needed popcorn

00:06:43.987 --> 00:06:46.698
to the people of Cineplex 14, okay?

00:06:47.824 --> 00:06:49.701
Leela, you've got mail.

00:06:50.494 --> 00:06:51.745
It's not spam.

00:06:51.828 --> 00:06:52.913
Huh?

00:06:53.997 --> 00:06:55.123
It's him.

00:06:55.207 --> 00:06:56.250
To Leela.

00:06:56.375 --> 00:06:58.794
Subject, hello. I am Alcazar.

00:06:58.877 --> 00:07:00.796
Fortunately, I wrote down your screen name

00:07:00.879 --> 00:07:02.923
before I was dispatched
by that oafish moron.

00:07:03.006 --> 00:07:04.132
Kicked your ass.

00:07:04.216 --> 00:07:05.843
Leela, we have much to discuss.

00:07:05.968 --> 00:07:08.136
Please come join me
on the planet of your birth.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:09.221
Coordinates follow.

00:07:11.598 --> 00:07:14.476
Well, too bad we've got
to make that urgent popcorn delivery.

00:07:17.145 --> 00:07:18.522
It'll get there.

00:07:43.714 --> 00:07:45.674
After a whole life of searching,

00:07:45.757 --> 00:07:47.759
I may finally have found where I belong.

00:07:47.843 --> 00:07:49.094
Too bad it's a dump.

00:07:52.764 --> 00:07:54.308
Look at that statue.

00:07:54.391 --> 00:07:55.726
It's only got one eye.

00:07:55.809 --> 00:07:56.935
Lazy sculptor.

00:07:57.019 --> 00:07:58.395
Welcome home, Leela.

00:07:58.478 --> 00:07:59.688
Alcazar?

00:08:00.647 --> 00:08:03.066
Are you real or am I seeing single?

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:04.484
Ow.

00:08:04.568 --> 00:08:05.819
Of course I'm real.

00:08:05.903 --> 00:08:09.531
After all this time,
somebody else with one eye,

00:08:09.615 --> 00:08:13.285
who isn't a clumsy carpenter
or a kid with a BB gun.

00:08:13.368 --> 00:08:15.662
It's all right, Leela.
You'll never be alone again.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.291
Come.

00:08:19.374 --> 00:08:21.418
Let me introduce you to yourself.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.254
- Do you mind if your servants walk?
- Not at all.

00:08:32.846 --> 00:08:35.015
We are the last remaining cyclopes.

00:08:35.098 --> 00:08:36.558
Our planet is Cyclopia.

00:08:36.642 --> 00:08:38.685
This is the capital, Cyclops City.

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:40.354
Stop me if I'm too fast for you.

00:08:40.479 --> 00:08:42.898
So much information, and yet, somehow

00:08:43.023 --> 00:08:45.067
I feel as if I know it all already.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:48.445
This sacred mosaic
depicts our goddess of beauty.

00:08:48.529 --> 00:08:51.615
Hmm. You got any
sacred artwork of her from the back?

00:08:51.698 --> 00:08:53.534
Her perfect eye
reminds me of yours, Leela.

00:08:53.867 --> 00:08:55.244
Had our race survived

00:08:55.327 --> 00:08:57.162
you would have been a temple priestess

00:08:57.287 --> 00:08:58.539
or a supermodel.

00:08:58.622 --> 00:09:00.457
Oh, please. Really?

00:09:11.426 --> 00:09:13.262
There's the infamous pirate, Purple beard,

00:09:13.345 --> 00:09:15.305
scourge of the six seas.

00:09:15.389 --> 00:09:16.515
What's over
that hill?

00:09:16.598 --> 00:09:17.724
The Forbidden Valley.

00:09:17.808 --> 00:09:20.018
A holy sanctuary
where no one may tread.

00:09:20.102 --> 00:09:21.562
Is that anything like a cemetery?

00:09:21.645 --> 00:09:23.355
'Cause I got to take a leak. Ow!

00:09:23.438 --> 00:09:25.899
Fry, that's offensive to our people.

00:09:25.983 --> 00:09:28.235
- Isn't it?
- Ow.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.823
This is my home.

00:09:32.906 --> 00:09:35.701
I hope you don't think less of me
because I live in a giant castle.

00:09:35.784 --> 00:09:37.578
Oh, no, not at all.

00:09:37.661 --> 00:09:39.496
If anything, I'm more impressed.

00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:46.003
Ooh. I'm going to need
to make some room.

00:09:48.172 --> 00:09:50.424
And here is where
I dream my lonely dreams

00:09:50.507 --> 00:09:52.134
and cook my simple meals.

00:09:52.217 --> 00:09:53.886
It's all so sad.

00:09:53.969 --> 00:09:56.054
What happened to our people?

00:10:01.602 --> 00:10:03.937
That's too painful to speak of now.

00:10:04.021 --> 00:10:05.772
Come. I'll show you your quarters.

00:10:11.486 --> 00:10:13.906
Ow. Ow. Ow.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.846
I heard you from my room.
What's wrong?

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.806
Nothing. It's just...

00:10:40.182 --> 00:10:41.183
No, Leela.

00:10:41.266 --> 00:10:43.143
I don't want to see tears
in your perfect eye.

00:10:43.435 --> 00:10:46.230
Please. Is it about the fate
of our people?

00:10:46.313 --> 00:10:48.398
Because I'm very interested in that.

00:10:48.482 --> 00:10:50.067
Well, okay. But it's chilly,

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:52.194
and you're going to be
all wet from the tears.

00:10:52.319 --> 00:10:53.946
Let's go into my chamber.

00:10:56.698 --> 00:10:58.700
It wasn't long ago,

00:10:58.784 --> 00:11:00.869
our people were happy and prosperous.

00:11:00.953 --> 00:11:03.497
But the eyeless mole people of Subterra 3

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.165
grew jealous of our visual prowess.

00:11:05.249 --> 00:11:08.710
They fired missiles in all directions,
hoping to hit Cyclopia.

00:11:11.004 --> 00:11:14.675
Unfortunately, one of
the 40 planets hit was ours.

00:11:14.758 --> 00:11:16.760
How far away do you think it is?

00:11:16.844 --> 00:11:17.928
A trillion miles?

00:11:20.948 --> 00:11:21.990
Things got hot.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.575
You look a little hot, actually.

00:11:23.659 --> 00:11:25.452
You could take off that jacket.

00:11:25.869 --> 00:11:27.371
Our people don't like to be hot.

00:11:27.454 --> 00:11:29.539
Anyway, just before the impact,

00:11:29.623 --> 00:11:32.751
our smartest scientist
managed to save one baby.

00:11:39.466 --> 00:11:41.718
Alcazar, I used to be a baby.

00:11:41.802 --> 00:11:43.136
It might have been me.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.722
Fortunately, I was employed
as a pool cleaner at the time.

00:11:45.806 --> 00:11:48.350
And when I emerged
from retrieving a dead possum

00:11:48.433 --> 00:11:50.352
I found I was the only one left.

00:11:51.561 --> 00:11:52.943
It's so tragic.

00:11:53.098 --> 00:11:56.643
Yes, but the real tragedy
is that our race ends with us.

00:11:56.942 --> 00:11:59.111
- It doesn't have to.
- What do you mean?

00:11:59.194 --> 00:12:00.654
You're a male.

00:12:00.737 --> 00:12:02.239
And I'm a female.

00:12:02.322 --> 00:12:03.865
I'm still not following you.

00:12:17.796 --> 00:12:19.298
Wake up, my king.

00:12:25.637 --> 00:12:26.805
Geez, what a night.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.473
Make me some coffee, would ya?

00:12:28.498 --> 00:12:30.459
Uh, sure. Okay.

00:12:30.684 --> 00:12:32.894
- What do you take with that?
- Pancakes and sausage.

00:12:32.978 --> 00:12:34.646
Kitchen's in basement,
pans in attic.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:38.233
Maybe after breakfast, we can talk about
rebuilding our civilization.

00:12:43.655 --> 00:12:44.656
Mmm.

00:12:45.365 --> 00:12:46.867
Great pancakes, Leela.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:50.579
Yeah, they'll come in handy
if I need to cover any tiny manholes.

00:12:55.584 --> 00:12:57.502
Listen, hon,
we don't want to look like slobs

00:12:57.586 --> 00:12:59.713
- in front of the other species, do we?
- No.

00:12:59.796 --> 00:13:01.256
So get to work on these dishes.

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.593
And then organize my collection
of naked celebrity photos.

00:13:04.676 --> 00:13:06.720
- Look, Alcazar...
- Call me Al.

00:13:06.803 --> 00:13:07.888
Look, Al.

00:13:07.971 --> 00:13:10.098
I know you've been
living alone a long time,

00:13:10.182 --> 00:13:11.350
and I can sympathize.

00:13:11.433 --> 00:13:12.726
But I'm not your maid.

00:13:12.809 --> 00:13:14.227
You're right. I'm sorry.

00:13:14.311 --> 00:13:16.313
I guess the relationship
isn't going to work out.

00:13:16.396 --> 00:13:19.232
So much for the cyclops race.
It was a pretty good race but...

00:13:19.316 --> 00:13:20.525
Okay, okay.

00:13:20.609 --> 00:13:22.194
I'll do the dishes.

00:13:22.277 --> 00:13:24.071
Hey, where'd they go?

00:13:28.784 --> 00:13:32.913
Leela is experiencing
the greatest joy a woman can feel,

00:13:32.996 --> 00:13:35.540
worshipping some lowlife jerk.

00:13:35.624 --> 00:13:39.002
He may be some lowlife jerk,
but I don't trust him.

00:13:39.086 --> 00:13:40.337
I think he's hiding something,

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:42.172
and I'm going to find out what it is.

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.888
Try and stop me.

00:13:53.767 --> 00:13:54.768
Al?

00:13:54.851 --> 00:13:57.104
I did my hair the way you wanted it.

00:14:00.315 --> 00:14:01.400
Who are these people?

00:14:01.483 --> 00:14:02.484
Friends.

00:14:03.235 --> 00:14:05.445
Hey, where'd you get this couch

00:14:05.529 --> 00:14:07.406
and that TV set and all this stuff?

00:14:07.489 --> 00:14:09.533
They were giving it away
on the street corner.

00:14:09.616 --> 00:14:10.784
Just like you, Leela.

00:14:13.245 --> 00:14:16.748
Too bad they weren't giving away
the three things you actually need,

00:14:16.832 --> 00:14:20.294
mouthwash, a back wax,
and stain-proof underwear.

00:14:20.377 --> 00:14:22.838
You go, girl!

00:14:22.921 --> 00:14:25.465
By the way, your pal Fry
fell into the dungeon.

00:14:25.549 --> 00:14:28.135
Take him a taco so
he doesn't die and stink up the place.

00:14:28.218 --> 00:14:29.553
Come on, Al.

00:14:29.636 --> 00:14:31.096
Can't you let the little guy out?

00:14:31.179 --> 00:14:33.682
Geez, Leela, twice in one day?

00:14:33.765 --> 00:14:35.017
I'm not Superman.

00:14:41.732 --> 00:14:44.735
Why were you sneaking
into my people's Forbidden Valley?

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.237
'Cause I think Alcazar's
hiding something from you.

00:14:47.321 --> 00:14:49.323
Listen, Leela, you may not like it.

00:14:49.406 --> 00:14:51.450
You may not believe it or want to hear it.

00:14:51.533 --> 00:14:54.077
But Alcazar's a jerk.
He's bad for you. He...

00:14:54.161 --> 00:14:56.496
- I know.
- You do?

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.958
Fry, if it's obvious to you
with your learning disability

00:15:00.042 --> 00:15:01.793
then, of course, it's obvious to me.

00:15:01.877 --> 00:15:04.671
He's crude and gross,
and he treats me like a slave.

00:15:04.755 --> 00:15:06.506
Then dump his one-eyed ass.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:07.591
I can't.

00:15:07.674 --> 00:15:10.802
If I leave Alcazar
that's the end of the cyclops race.

00:15:10.886 --> 00:15:12.387
And I won't let that happen,

00:15:12.471 --> 00:15:14.681
even if it means
a lifetime of unhappiness.

00:15:16.391 --> 00:15:18.852
Leela, mop up in aisle number two.

00:15:21.772 --> 00:15:23.231
I'll break up with him at dinner.

00:15:23.315 --> 00:15:25.108
I'll be there.

00:15:27.194 --> 00:15:28.820
Yo, Leela, what gives?

00:15:28.904 --> 00:15:30.530
Pig says your slop tastes like crap.

00:15:30.614 --> 00:15:32.950
Yeah, like crap.

00:15:33.033 --> 00:15:34.034
Come on, Leela.

00:15:34.159 --> 00:15:36.578
You deserve better than this guy.
Dump him already.

00:15:36.662 --> 00:15:37.871
I'm trying.

00:15:38.747 --> 00:15:41.166
Hey, everyone,
jam a sock in your spit faucets.

00:15:42.459 --> 00:15:44.795
Not long ago, I spent my lonely nights

00:15:44.878 --> 00:15:47.381
renting slasher flicks
with Ratman and his girlfriend.

00:15:47.464 --> 00:15:49.466
But then a beautiful woman arrived...

00:15:49.549 --> 00:15:50.759
Stop eating, Pig!

00:15:50.842 --> 00:15:54.680
...and she brought new hope for me
and our once-great civilization.

00:15:54.763 --> 00:15:57.474
Now, a million centuries
of cyclops destiny

00:15:57.599 --> 00:15:59.935
depend on the answer
to one question.

00:16:00.519 --> 00:16:03.105
Leela, will you marry me?

00:16:03.188 --> 00:16:04.773
No. No.

00:16:04.856 --> 00:16:06.483
Yes, I will!

00:16:06.566 --> 00:16:07.651
Oh!

00:16:11.113 --> 00:16:13.156
They're getting married.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.668
Congratulations, Leela.

00:16:25.794 --> 00:16:28.422
- Glad you could make it.
- It's a magical day.

00:16:28.505 --> 00:16:30.090
Welcome!

00:16:40.851 --> 00:16:42.894
Psst, Leela!
You've got to get me out of here.

00:16:42.978 --> 00:16:44.938
It's horrible. Eating scraps,

00:16:45.022 --> 00:16:48.358
letting my waste drop wherever it falls
like an animal in a zoo.

00:16:48.442 --> 00:16:49.943
Animals go in the corner.

00:16:50.027 --> 00:16:52.654
The corner. Why didn't I think of that?

00:16:52.738 --> 00:16:55.282
Look, Fry, I'd like to help you

00:16:55.365 --> 00:16:57.618
but it's my wedding, and I'm kind of busy.

00:16:57.701 --> 00:16:59.953
Here. Try to be happy for me.

00:17:00.078 --> 00:17:01.788
That way, at least one of us will be.

00:17:02.456 --> 00:17:03.665
That's it.

00:17:03.749 --> 00:17:05.876
It's time for this bird to walk.

00:17:14.885 --> 00:17:15.969
Ow!

00:17:17.721 --> 00:17:20.766
Bender! Come on, we've got to
get some dirt on Alcazar.

00:17:20.849 --> 00:17:23.977
Let's go find out what makes the
Forbidden Valley so forbidden.

00:17:24.061 --> 00:17:25.896
Uh, no thanks. I'm good.

00:17:25.979 --> 00:17:28.649
But there's probably some cool
forbidden stuff you can steal.

00:17:28.732 --> 00:17:30.275
I don't know, Fry.

00:17:30.359 --> 00:17:33.195
For the first time in my life, I feel like

00:17:33.278 --> 00:17:35.030
I've stolen enough.

00:17:35.113 --> 00:17:37.032
Bender, snap out of it.

00:17:38.575 --> 00:17:40.327
Sorry. I don't know
what came over me.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.411
Let's go!

00:17:42.704 --> 00:17:44.539
I love stealin'

00:17:44.623 --> 00:17:46.541
I love takin' things

00:17:57.594 --> 00:18:01.181
That pig over there is wearing
the same sandals as me.

00:18:04.309 --> 00:18:06.228
Come on, boy, jump!

00:18:06.311 --> 00:18:08.021
Good boy.

00:18:08.105 --> 00:18:09.773
Whoa, mittens.

00:18:12.776 --> 00:18:13.860
My god!

00:18:13.944 --> 00:18:16.071
Four identical castles.

00:18:16.154 --> 00:18:19.574
Each more identical than the last.

00:18:20.701 --> 00:18:22.703
That's weird. It's another cyclops.

00:18:22.786 --> 00:18:24.538
Only this one has five eyes.

00:18:24.621 --> 00:18:27.332
And here's another one with no eyes.

00:18:28.625 --> 00:18:32.087
Does anyone have a reason
why this couple

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.172
shall not be joined

00:18:34.256 --> 00:18:37.718
in the irrevocable shackles of holy bliss?

00:18:37.801 --> 00:18:40.053
Saving a race of one-eyed monsters?

00:18:40.137 --> 00:18:41.388
Who could object to that?

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.975
Cut to the chase, preach.

00:18:45.058 --> 00:18:47.060
Do you, Alcazar, take this woman...

00:18:47.144 --> 00:18:48.812
...in sickness, to love, death, part?

00:18:48.895 --> 00:18:50.314
Yeah, sure, I do. Come on, faster!

00:18:50.397 --> 00:18:52.691
Do you, Leela,
copy and paste his response

00:18:52.774 --> 00:18:54.318
till death do you part?

00:19:02.868 --> 00:19:04.661
I...

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.334
Oh, my god.

00:19:10.459 --> 00:19:12.377
- What the...
- Hey, Alcazar,

00:19:12.461 --> 00:19:14.379
you left somebody
off the guest list.

00:19:15.714 --> 00:19:16.798
Alcazar!

00:19:17.257 --> 00:19:19.635
Why you are so late
for our wedding?

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.595
And why you have only one eye?

00:19:21.678 --> 00:19:23.096
It's...

00:19:23.347 --> 00:19:24.431
Oh.

00:19:25.432 --> 00:19:26.892
Uh... Hey, sweetie.

00:19:26.975 --> 00:19:28.810
Just go back to the castle
and wait for me.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.438
She... She's nuts.

00:19:32.022 --> 00:19:35.943
I can morph into a five-eyed alien
and I kind of said I'd marry her.

00:19:36.026 --> 00:19:39.905
But I'm really a cyclops
and I'm really going to marry you.

00:19:39.988 --> 00:19:42.699
Oh, yeah?
Then what about this?

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.163
This is a bit awkward.

00:19:48.246 --> 00:19:49.873
- Who's she?
- Who's she?

00:19:49.957 --> 00:19:51.041
Who are they?

00:19:51.124 --> 00:19:52.876
Go back to the castle, Sandy.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.711
And maybe you'd like to meet her

00:19:54.795 --> 00:19:56.129
and her.

00:19:58.674 --> 00:20:00.634
This...

00:20:00.801 --> 00:20:01.802
Leela...

00:20:01.885 --> 00:20:04.137
This must all be very confusing.

00:20:04.221 --> 00:20:05.222
A little.

00:20:05.305 --> 00:20:08.100
That's why I've decided to hurt you
until you explain it.

00:20:13.397 --> 00:20:15.315
Show us your real form.

00:20:15.399 --> 00:20:16.650
- Yeah!
- Do it!

00:20:29.037 --> 00:20:32.791
Well, this is the real me,
but I can explain.

00:20:32.874 --> 00:20:34.543
We all have needs.

00:20:34.626 --> 00:20:36.503
Mine was to make it with five weirdos

00:20:36.586 --> 00:20:38.630
and have them scrub my five castles.

00:20:38.714 --> 00:20:40.340
I gave you all what you wanted

00:20:40.424 --> 00:20:41.842
and, of course, I made
a few bucks

00:20:41.925 --> 00:20:43.802
letting Pig watch
through the two-way mirror.

00:20:43.885 --> 00:20:45.679
Can any of you say
you wouldn't have done

00:20:45.762 --> 00:20:47.556
the exact same thing in my position?

00:20:48.974 --> 00:20:50.392
He's a saint.

00:20:50.475 --> 00:20:53.520
But why did you have all
five weddings on the same day?

00:20:53.604 --> 00:20:56.815
Hey, lady, you got any idea what it costs
to rent a tux that changes shape?

00:20:56.898 --> 00:20:58.483
All right, Alcazar.

00:20:58.567 --> 00:21:01.695
- I just have one last question for you.
- What's that?

00:21:01.778 --> 00:21:03.280
If you could change form

00:21:03.363 --> 00:21:06.199
why didn't you change it
in the one place that counts?

00:21:17.294 --> 00:21:19.588
Thanks for saving me
from that creep, Fry.

00:21:19.671 --> 00:21:21.340
Hey, that's what I do.

00:21:21.423 --> 00:21:24.593
I guess I was so desperate
to find out who I really was

00:21:24.676 --> 00:21:26.511
I forgot who I really was.

00:21:26.595 --> 00:21:27.888
No harm done.

00:21:27.971 --> 00:21:30.223
In the many decades
you'll work to repay me

00:21:30.307 --> 00:21:32.726
for that shipment of popcorn
you destroyed

00:21:32.809 --> 00:21:36.229
you'll have plenty of time
to search for your true home.

00:21:36.313 --> 00:21:37.314
Yeah.

00:21:37.397 --> 00:21:40.734
I mean, how many planets
can there be?